  "decision_conditions": [
    "a) The rating level of noise emitted from plant and equipment shall be at least 5 dB below the existing background noise level (LA90,T) when measured or predicted at the nearest noise-sensitive premises, in accordance with BS 4142:2014+A1:2019.\r\nb) The plant and associated acoustic mitigation measures shall be installed, operated and maintained strictly in accordance with the approved report 'RP.260330.0 – Plant Noise Assessment, Aran Acoustics Ltd (March 2026)'. The acoustic enclosures shall achieve performance equal to or better than that specified within the assessment.\r\nc) All plant shall be installed in accordance with the manufacturer’s recommendations and shall be properly serviced and maintained thereafter to ensure the acoustic performance is retained.\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development occurs in accordance with the submitted Acoustic Assessment, and, to ensure that amenity impacts as a result of the proposal are suitably mitigated."
